# a client without AZP or REQUIRE takes what no more specific client takes - and only that
statement ok
ACL ADMIN CREATE CLIENT catchall ISSUER kc AUDIENCES ('api://acl-test') ROLES FROM ('roles') UNMAPPED AS ROLE ATTRIBUTES (tenant = 'tenant');

